~ enter_bunker_2
if Event.check_flag(\"ShardGardens/Bunker2Open\"):
	Daze.Neutral: You should've tried touching it without the orb...
	Mira.Neutral: Sorry, didn't think this through-
	Asteria.Neutral: Don't worry much about it, there are more doors like this.
else:
	$> camera_move(Vector2(0, 50))
	Mira.Neutral: So we can go in now?
	I reach my hand to the machine
	Daze.Neutral: LEVENOR, DON'T-[next]
	[hide][next]
	$> Event.add_flag(\"ShardGardens/Bunker2Open\")
	$> check.emit()
	$> screen_shake(2, 20, 0.4)
	$> screen_shake(10, 5, 0.2)
	$> Event.wait(2)
	$> camera_move(player.position)
	Mira.Shocked: E- End of content!?
	Daze.Neutral: Seems this is as far as we're going today.
	Asteria.Neutral: Thank you so much for playing!
	Alcine.Laugh: Wheeeaaa!
	$> Loader.save()
	$>> run_cue(\"testbush\", \"demo_credits\")
=> END
